file construction/archive/REDS-silence-and-cleanliness-read-alike-rows-513.md the shelf for the closed row, header written by hand as the fold tool requires
file construction/archive/REDS-a-handler-that-cleans-up-and-carries-on-rows-487.md the oldest foldable row, shelved to bring the pin back under its bound
