status GREEN for this lap's own work -- ascii_comment_witness green with six new asserts, reds_ledger and equinox_e123_living_pin_guard green where both refused at the open. The hot pass's two reds are a park this tree's round-open made before the lap began, named above and not routed around
recommend keep-going -- my two rows are 20260906.211015 (CLOSED) and 20260906.211529 (OPEN), cited by stamp until the spine binds them. The next lap in this tree should recover the parked package at refs/heads/pier/diverged-20260906-210007, which is what both hot-pass reds are reading. %513 is closed both ways against its own elder files; %514 is OPEN and wants Keaton's word before a hook eight ships run is changed. Two sized finds stay unclaimed: 10 of 244 scans still drop awk's stderr, and the card holds three bytes of headroom, which is %514's own shape one room over.
